I've enhanced the default knitr plot hook to automatically generate
\begin and \end{figure} if you specify for example <<chunkname,
caption=some caption>>.  You don't need fig=TRUE at any rate.  I could
not figure out how to get knitr to allow a comma in the caption - it
doesn't allow caption=". . ." or {. . .} or "<. . .>".  Unless someone
has a better idea I'll intercept ;; inside caption= and change it to a
comma, inside the hook.

Frank

