Oh, I meant to update the online documentation on how to use a
customized device yesterday but did not manage to do it. Basically you
just define a function, but one important thing to do is to provide
the chunk option fig.ext (file extension of the figure) because I
cannot guess it automatically from a custom device. In your case, you
can use fig.ext=pdf.

